# Git push — mega-series roadmap

When the user asks to **commit**, **push**, or create a **pull request** for this repo (`writers-ai-memory` / inferStories):

1. Check `git status` for `docs/MEGA_SERIES_ROADMAP.md`.
2. If it is untracked or modified, **stage and include it** in the commit unless the user explicitly excludes it.
3. This file is the living product roadmap (Tier 1–3 mega-series author features); it should stay in version control with the project.

Do not commit unless the user explicitly requests a commit.
